     1	---
     2	title: 命令
     3	description: 为重复任务创建自定义命令。
     4	---
     5	
     6	自定义命令允许你指定一个提示词，当在 TUI 中执行该命令时会运行这个提示词。
     7	
     8	```bash frame="none"
     9	/my-command
    10	```
    11	
    12	自定义命令是 `/init`、`/undo`、`/redo`、`/share`、`/help` 等内置命令之外的补充。[了解更多](/docs/tui#commands)。
    13	
    14	---
    15	
    16	## 创建命令文件
    17	
    18	在 `commands/` 目录中创建 markdown 文件来定义自定义命令。
    19	
    20	创建 `.opencode/commands/test.md`：
    21	
    22	```md title=".opencode/commands/test.md"
    23	---
    24	description: Run tests with coverage
    25	agent: build
    26	model: anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022
    27	---
    28	
    29	Run the full test suite with coverage report and show any failures.
    30	Focus on the failing tests and suggest fixes.
    31	```
    32	
    33	frontmatter 定义命令属性，内容则成为模板。
    34	
    35	通过输入 `/` 后跟命令名称来使用该命令。
    36	
    37	```bash frame="none"
    38	"/test"
    39	```
    40	
    41	---
    42	
    43	## 配置
    44	
    45	你可以通过 OpenCode 配置或在 `commands/` 目录中创建 markdown 文件来添加自定义命令。
    46	
    47	---
    48	
    49	### JSON
    50	
    51	在 OpenCode [配置](/docs/config)中使用 `command` 选项：
    52	
    53	```json title="opencode.jsonc" {4-12}
    54	{
    55	  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
    56	  "command": {
    57	    // This becomes the name of the command
    58	    "test": {
    59	      // This is the prompt that will be sent to the LLM
    60	      "template": "Run the full test suite with coverage report and show any failures.\nFocus on the failing tests and suggest fixes.",
    61	      // This is shown as the description in the TUI
    62	      "description": "Run tests with coverage",
    63	      "agent": "build",
    64	      "model": "anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022"
    65	    }
    66	  }
    67	}
    68	```
    69	
    70	现在你可以在 TUI 中运行这个命令：
    71	
    72	```bash frame="none"
    73	/test
    74	```
    75	
    76	---
    77	
    78	### Markdown
    79	
    80	你还可以使用 markdown 文件定义命令。将它们放在：
    81	
    82	- 全局：`~/.config/opencode/commands/`
    83	- 项目级：`.opencode/commands/`
    84	
    85	```markdown title="~/.config/opencode/commands/test.md"
    86	---
    87	description: Run tests with coverage
    88	agent: build
    89	model: anthropic/claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022
    90	---
    91	
    92	Run the full test suite with coverage report and show any failures.
    93	Focus on the failing tests and suggest fixes.
    94	```
    95	
    96	markdown 文件名即为命令名。例如，`test.md` 允许你运行：
    97	
    98	```bash frame="none"
    99	/test
   100	```
   101	
   102	---
   103	
   104	## 提示词配置
   105	
   106	自定义命令的提示词支持多种特殊占位符和语法。
   107	
   108	---
   109	
   110	### 参数
   111	
   112	使用 `$ARGUMENTS` 占位符向命令传递参数。
   113	
   114	```md title=".opencode/commands/component.md"
   115	---
   116	description: Create a new component
   117	---
   118	
   119	Create a new React component named $ARGUMENTS with TypeScript support.
   120	Include proper typing and basic structure.

